{"id":"vod_sn_38872","vodId":"38872","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔卡少女樱","name_cn":"魔卡少女樱","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/377ab7e13081f21347b612bc11330a82.jpg"},"summary":"小学生木之本樱（丹下樱 配音）是一个平凡的女孩，有一个温柔的爸爸木之本藤隆（田中秀幸 配音）和一个体贴的好友大道寺知世（岩男润子 配音）。一天，在父亲的书房中她发现了一本尘封已久的魔法书，并无意间解除了书上的封印，一只会说话的玩偶可鲁贝洛斯（久川绫 配音）出现在了她的面前。小可告诉她，自己是守护这本书的神兽，书中封印着名叫库洛牌的东西。现在，封印解除了，它要小樱成为库洛魔法师，它将协助她收复这些四处捣乱的库洛牌。隔天，小樱的班上转来了一个名叫李小狼（熊井素子 配音）的转学生，这个外表酷酷的男孩原来也是冲着库洛牌而来。　　随着库洛牌的封印，越来越多的角色出现在了小樱的身边，而他们的真正目的，却还不得而知。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":70,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/twgue2gAna1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zgrQhW3E4z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j1wnu5LbPh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9Z5fJc0dki1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hdCZzMGmSh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9rBnjyvvM81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/5DQSHJzjrC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/366LR0ZaDB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/NH4RJGyLcS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UxVtE7CsqU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/cDqhJB9VdQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/33uuwPbRNE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xcK5XFtXaP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/k93XJyFvEF1/video/index.m3